      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "main is locked (it can only be changed by a merge). Positions on the diagram, the size and look of writing cards, tags and the project's settings can still be changed. Change the contents in a branch or with “Group edit”."
