            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Overwrites the target's layout with the positions of the cards, card ghosts, flow nodes and section ghosts moved in the branch, and with the sizes of writing cards and the boxes of a goal's contents map (also into a locked main). When off, the target's layout stays, and positions go in only for things the target has no position for (such as cards made in the branch)."
